"olsun, verinizden anlamlı içgörüler elde edebiliriz."
msgstr ""
"We work with companies from every data-generating sector, especially "
"finance, retail, healthcare, manufacturing, e-commerce, and the public "
"sector. Whatever your industry, we can extract meaningful insights from your"
" data."

#: forum/templates/forum/proje_talebi.html:318
msgid "Veri gizliliğim nasıl korunuyor?"
msgstr "How is my data privacy protected?"

